<title>JAPAN: FIGURE SKATING-RESULTS AT NHK TROPHY.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-RESULTS AT NHK TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results at the NHK Trophy figure skating competition on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men' Final</p>
<p>  1. Elvis Stojko (Canada)	    2.0 points</p>
<p>  2. Ilia Kulik (Russia)		 2.5</p>
<p>  3. Dmitry Dmitrenko (Ukraine)	6.0</p>
<p>  4. Scott Davis (U.S.A.)		6.5</p>
<p>  5. Eric Millot (France)		8.0</p>
<p>  6. Guo Zhengxin (China)		9.0</p>
<p>  7. Philippe Candeloro (France)    11.5</p>
<p>  8. Cornel Gheorghe (Romania)	12.0</p>
<p>  9. Takeshi Honda (Japan)	    12.5</p>
<p> 10. Michael Shmerkin (Israel)	15.5</p>
</text>
